WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
If the guest is in a hurry

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:04,920
You can go to other convenience stores to check the situation. I won’t send you off. Goodbye.

3
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,360
I just couldn't resist one

4
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:07,560
The power of little humans

5
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:11,380
This is very wrong

6
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:13,140
Why hasn’t the shift replacement arrived yet?

7
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:18,230
You're so unruly, what do you do to me?

8
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:23,140
I am still alive because you are still alive. If you are saved, hold on.

9
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:25,820
It's been twelve hours, probably midnight

10
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:26,940
There will be a big wave of passengers

11
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:29,100
Victory is in front of you, don't give up now

12
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:32,300
Choose a position to trade with me

13
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:33,910
What organ is missing?

14
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:35,030
Won't die soon

15
00:00:35,770 --> 00:00:37,450
It takes at least twelve hours

16
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:40,650
I want to live Store Manager

17
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:42,010
When will the shift replacement come?

18
00:00:42,170 --> 00:00:43,210
It's already time to get off work

19
00:00:43,610 --> 00:00:44,970
It's not time to get off work yet

20
00:00:45,410 --> 00:00:47,880
Are you lazy now? It's eight o'clock?

21
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:49,760
Didn't you say you get off work at eight o'clock?

22
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:51,120
It's time to get off work

23
00:00:51,870 --> 00:00:56,190
It's eight o'clock in the morning. What morning do you mean?

24
00:00:56,430 --> 00:00:57,390
You keep us working continuously

25
00:00:57,390 --> 00:00:58,510
twenty four hours

26
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:03,300
Pay my salary for today
